      "top": "A turning disc: the sigil and frost on the ground, the funnel's wall seen from above as a spiral, bones racing around it and scattering outward at the end.",
      "three_quarter": "Hero view. The funnel has height and spin, bones tumble around it at every height, wisps glow inside and the frost and sigil show beneath."
